## Memory

All persistent memory lives in `./memory/` inside this repo — **not** in `~/.claude/`.
Always read from and write to `./memory/` for this project.

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `memory/MEMORY.md` | Index of all memory files |

Memory format: frontmatter with `name`, `description`, `type` (user/feedback/project/reference), then content body.

